# r1115 phase 6, boot A1: CD fix-2 reruns (SQ-SPD-08b, SQ-BBQW-02t, SQ-SLK-01c; rows at the end of "SQ-SPD / SQ-SLK and
# Creative Delight fixes") and SQ-SY-14 + id lookups for the SY wave 2 rows (p6_a2.qb, same boot).
# Server: NOSWAP=1 prep_srv.sh OUT p6a1 A spawn-animals=true difficulty=normal (superflat, ground top y -61).
# Before boot, copy into OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/: hh_crow_probe.js (zhh3), c2_probe.js (zc2), zp_probe.js (zp),
#   zc4_probe.js (zc4), tools/soil_yield_probe/sy_probe.js (syt), each as zz_<name>; zq comes from prep_srv.sh.
# srv toml: hearthandharvest-common.toml [salt] saltLickInterval 200, saltSearchInterval 20, saltAnimalStageChance 1.0;
#   loadingprotection-common.toml '"Loading Protection Configuration"' protectionDuration 1.
# Rows copied from p4_a1.qb (SQ-SPD-08, -08x, -06, SQ-BBQW-02s, -02) and p4_a1b.qb (SQ-SLK-01b).
# Basin: 2 slots; facing north -> slot = (1 - hit x) * 2: hit x 0.75 = slot 0 (beef), 0.25 = slot 1 (empty).
pace 1

## P6-setup | gamerules, forceloads, probe check (not a test row)
bootexpect Done \(
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 0
> time set noon
> weather clear
> forceload add 700 490 720 590
> forceload add 296 356 316 376
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run forceload add 700 490 720 510
sleep 5
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> zc4 cmd zhh3,zc2,zp,zq,syt
waitlog \[zc4\] done 20
reject \[zc4\] cmd \w+ missing

## SQ-SY-14 | boot lines: Fortune strip on 70+ tables, 36 crops, nether soils, no "no base", PickSoilYieldMixin applied
bootexpect \[soil-yield\] Fortune stripped: \d+ terms on ([7-9]\d|\d{3,}) crop tables
bootexpect \[soil-yield\] 36 crops \(.*sweet_berry.*\)
bootexpect \[soil-yield\] 36 crops \(.*lemon.*\)
bootexpect \[soil-yield\] 36 crops \(.*nether_wart.*\)
bootexpect \[soil-yield\] 36 crops \(.*crimson_fungus_colony.*\)
bootexpect rich soul soil \+33%, fertile soul soil \+66%
bootreject no base in soil_yield\.json
bootreject PickSoilYieldMixin.*(fail|error|Error|could not)
bootreject Mixin apply.*SoilYield
shell grep -h "\[soil-yield\]\|\[botany_pots\]" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-1500 | sort -u
shell grep -ic "PickSoilYield" logs/latest.log; grep -i "mixin" logs/latest.log | grep -i "creativedelight" | grep -iE "error|fail|warn" | head -5
look shell lines: soils list and crop list as the pass text

