## SQ-BBQW-02t | stick on each slot of a warped basin holding one beef: CONSUME, stick kept, no stick block, basin 1 beef
> fill 296 -60 356 316 -56 376 minecraft:air
> pbot spawn c6b 303.5 -60 366.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> clear c6b
> setblock 304 -60 372 barbequesdelight:warped_basin[facing=north]{Items:{Items:[{Slot:0,id:"minecraft:beef",Count:1b}]}}
> pbot hold c6b minecraft:stick 1
> zc2 useat c6b 304 -60 372 0.75 0.2 0.5 up
> zc2 useat c6b 304 -60 372 0.25 0.2 0.5 up
sleep 1
> zc2 inv 304 -60 372
> zc2 state 304 -59 372
> zq count 302 -60 370 306 -58 374 supplementaries:stick
> zp inv c6b
waitlog \[zp\] done 20
count \[zc2\] useat c6b main CONSUME; main now 1 minecraft:stick == 2
expect \[zp\] inv c6b: .*minecraft:stick
expect count supplementaries:stick: 0\b
reject \[zc2\] useat c6b main PASS
look basin inv 0:1 minecraft:beef only; state above the basin air

## SQ-BBQW-02 | skewering on a warped basin still works (2 beef, stick, cabbage in the off hand)
> clear c6b
> setblock 302 -60 370 barbequesdelight:warped_basin[facing=north]{Items:{Items:[{Slot:0,id:"minecraft:beef",Count:2b}]}}
> zc2 inv 302 -60 370
> pbot hold c6b minecraft:stick 1
> item replace entity c6b weapon.offhand with farmersdelight:cabbage 2
> zc2 useat c6b 302 -60 370 0.75 0.2 0.5 up
sleep 1
> zc2 inv 302 -60 370
> zp inv c6b
waitlog \[zp\] done 20
expect \[zp\] inv c6b: .*barbequesdelight:raw_beef_skewer
> clear c6b
> pbot remove c6b

## SQ-SLK-01c | cow at 18 blocks: reaches the salt and licks it within 1600 ticks (interval 200, stage chance 1.0)
> forceload add 21890 3994 21950 4006
sleep 3
> kill @e[type=!player,x=21890,y=-62,z=3994,dx=60,dy=8,dz=12]
> fill 21890 -61 3994 21950 -56 4006 minecraft:glass hollow
> pbot spawn c603 21891 -60 3995 minecraft:overworld creative
sleep 2
> zhh3 cfgdump
> setblock 21920 -60 4000 salt:salt_block
> summon minecraft:cow 21938 -60 4000 {NoAI:1b,Tags:["s603"]}
> zhh3 watch minecraft:cow 21920 -60 4000 3 80 20 s3 21920.5,-59.5,4000.5
> zhh3 watch minecraft:cow 21920 -60 4000 22 80 20 w3 21920.5,-59.5,4000.5
> execute as @e[tag=s603] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:0b}
waitlog \[zhh3\] watch w3 done 120
> zhh3 seen w3 StayNearSaltGoal
> zhh3 block 21920 -60 4000
> pbot remove c603
> kill @e[type=minecraft:cow,x=21890,y=-62,z=3994,dx=60,dy=8,dz=12]
> forceload remove 21890 3994 21950 4006
expect \[zhh3\] watch s3 done samples=\d+ count=[1-9]
expect \[zhh3\] block 21920 -60 4000 hearthandharvest:\w*licked_salt_block
look w3 minD; the block a licked stage (lightly_licked); air would be the cow licking it fully away (also a lick)
